# APP SECURITY — gates

1. Audit only the current APP security shard and its declared surfaces.
2. Record findings in `memory-bank/app/security/implement/<epic_id>/aNN-*.yaml`; do not change product code in the audit.
3. Cover API authorization, UI visibility, wire exposure and relevant external boundaries.
4. Security PASS is evidence for APP; it does not create an INTEG lifecycle.
